,"date":"2013-09-30T18:00:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9417455196380615,"text_excerpt":"I'm always on the lookout for places with fresh produce....good prices earn brownie points. This Fresh Market has a large selection of veggies and fruits. Priced a bit on the higher side but you can get away with buying a bunch of produce that's on sale. I don't mind spending a bit more if I get the quality I want. Too bad the strawberries I bought went bad the next day...but that's an exception to their quality. They have delicious coffee samples, which is my guilty pleasure while shopping here. Not to mention that coffee is located right next to their awesome candy isle. They have everything you'd want. It's a personal challenge to leave this store without a piece of candy. Try their po..."},{"business_id":"dM2LrfuOqlRHdRKI_FFwCg","review_id":"PF8sL5Phf0WwiwtNukJeyg","date":"2018-07-09T05:21:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9403060674667358,"text_excerpt":"Fresh Market is the bomb. Their bakery section is a work of art; the cakes and pastries are nothing short of exquisite, and everything tastes as good as it looks. Their coffee selection is awesome, and they sample them daily so you know what you're buying. They even have fancy decaf flavors. The olive bar is respectable, and they carry a very nice selection of sauces and soups. What I'm really in love with, though, are the bulk candies. Malt balls and jelly beans and chocolate coated everything! And did I mention the employees are super cool and will let you sample? The only reason they're not getting a solid five is their produce prices, which are on par with whole foods, possibly a litt..."},{"business_id":"dM2LrfuOqlRHdRKI_FFwCg","review_id":"Z8XR2qcO-tlxZKBH5ddm4g","date":"2018-03-26T01:42:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9387997984886169,"text_excerpt":"Okay Fresh Market-I really do love you. I remember visiting New Orleans and passing this place by on the streetcar, always wondering what the heck was inside this brightly lit up mansion looking place. It's an adorable grocery store inside with anything you could possibly need. Their prices are a little insane and that's why I can only buy certain things here- like when their fruit is on sale, or bulk coffee, or their amazing bread (seriously some of the best bread I've ever had....). Most things are outrageously over priced. However, it's the closest grocery store to me and they really do carry anything you could need. Plus, their sales are pretty decent! AND! It never seems to be super ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dM2LrfuOqlRHdRKI_FFwCg","photo_id":"KPMcio8BdHmlNOjRm844sA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/KPMcio8BdHmlNOjRm844sA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8947296142578125},{"business_id":"dM2LrfuOqlRHdRKI_FFwCg","photo_id":"UfJDOfxByOkdQdyzH0i2Qg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UfJDOfxByOkdQdyzH0i2Qg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8697908520698547},{"business_id":"dM2LrfuOqlRHdRKI_FFwCg","photo_id":"nB-0r1ES8bnQQPOjFA5cHQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nB-0r1ES8bnQQPOjFA5cHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8376511335372925},{"business_id":"dM2LrfuOqlRHdRKI_FFwCg","photo_id":"aeXkjohF_aDrGU7dXpwj1w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aeXkjohF_aDrGU7dXpwj1w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8043581247329712},{"business_id":"dM2LrfuOqlRHdRKI_FFwCg","photo_id":"8az4Yhd1Geqwkwi_WLI7Yw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8az4Yhd1Geqwkwi_WLI7Yw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7655002474784851}]},"notebook_case":null}
